7053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春到","author":"姜特立","text":"春到天寒花未芳，老人寸寸惜流光。\n攀条先试东风手，蜂蝶如知合断肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37582,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春物","author":"姜特立","text":"一春天富贵，万象物光华。\n遥想西湖上，风流卖酒家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37583,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昭君","author":"姜特立","text":"汉宫胡地真天壤，一别长门隔塞云。\n莫谓琵琶慰行役，琴心不比卓文君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37584,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柳","author":"姜特立","text":"长条攀折叹离披，底事人间管别离。\n何似龙津通御气，建章宫里斗腰支。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37585,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柳","author":"姜特立","text":"森森万木势峥嵘，千尺孤标更上征。\n惟有柳丝低拂路，腰支憔悴为多情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37586,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柳絮","author":"姜特立","text":"随风弄日碎春云，扑户穿帷恼杀人。\n底事飘扬少拘束，爱将豪纵去酬春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":37587,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洗竹","author":"姜特立","text":"脩篁君子性，枝蔓谩相妨